FILESEXTRAPATHS:prepend := "${THISDIR}/${PN}:"

# meta-balena branch: the rpi-enable-bootscr.cfg CONFIG_BOOTCOMMAND override
# (boot.scr sourced from fixed mmc devices) is the standalone/mender boot
# flow and is NOT injected here. balenaOS boots these boards through the
# stock OE-Core u-boot distro-boot, which sources the boot.scr generated by
# balena-seeed-cm4's rpi-u-boot-scr recipe (machine-specific boot.cmd, e.g.
# the r100x/r110x self-contained "load Image from the FAT boot partition and
# booti" flow). Applying the override there hijacks bootcmd and breaks the
# balenaOS boot chain. The standalone build keeps the injection on main.

# The 8de24e226d7 backport (bcmstb non-removable fix needed for R22 eMMC)
# is no longer carried here: meta-raspberrypi wrynose ships the same
# upstream commit as recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/8de24e226d7.patch via
# u-boot_2026.01.bbappend, and applying it twice fails do_patch with
# "can be reverse-applied".

